; XAUUSD_MTF_RSI_MACD_BB_EA - "max frequency" preset
; In MT5: Strategy Tester > Expert Advisor: XAUUSD_MTF_RSI_MACD_BB_EA > Inputs tab > Load
; or on the chart's EA Inputs dialog > Load.
;
; WHAT THIS CHANGES vs. the Default preset - and what it deliberately does NOT:
;
; Same signal quality bar as Default (InpEntryThreshold=55.0,
; InpMinAgreeingTF=2, all indicator settings unchanged) - a trade still needs
; the same 2-of-3-timeframes-at-conviction evidence to fire. What changes is
; everything that can block an otherwise-VALID signal from actually filling:
;
;   InpAllowOpposite       false -> true   (a fresh signal can open against
;                                            an already-open opposite position
;                                            instead of being skipped)
;   InpEntryOpenBufferMin  5 -> 1           (barely any dead time after the
;                                            session opens)
;   InpEntryCloseBufferMin 30 -> 5          (entries allowed almost up to the
;                                            session close)
;   InpFlattenBeforeCloseMin 10 -> 5        (flattens later, closer to the
;                                            actual session end)
;   InpSessionStartHour/Min,                24h manual-fallback window (only
;   InpSessionEndHour/Min  6-23 -> 0-0      matters if InpUseBrokerSession is
;                                            switched off - 0/0/0/0 is this
;                                            EA's "always" sentinel)
;   InpMaxSpreadPoints     350 -> 800       lets entries through in far wider
;                                            spread conditions (still capped,
;                                            so a genuine broker/feed outage
;                                            with an extreme spread is still
;                                            blocked)
;   InpMaxTradesPerDay     0 (unchanged)    already unlimited in Default
;
; DELIBERATELY UNCHANGED - these are risk controls, not throttles, and this
; preset does not touch them: InpFixedLot (0.01), InpMaxOpenPositions (4),
; InpStopLossPips (60 = $6.00), InpTrailPips (50 = $5.00),
; InpTakeProfitPips (50 = $5.00), InpMaxDailyLossPct (1.0%),
; InpLockDailyGains / InpLockAfterPct / InpGiveBackPct (the profit lock).
; Those are the $-risk figures that were specified for this EA and stay in
; force regardless of how often it trades.
;
; NET EFFECT: more of the signals this EA already finds get taken - not more
; signals. A wider spread cap and same-symbol opposite trades both increase
; average cost per trade (worse average fill on a wide spread; an opposite
; entry pays the spread twice while largely netting against the existing
; position) - expect more trades AND a higher cost drag per trade. The daily
; loss cap and 4-position ceiling are exactly as reachable, just faster.
;
; Note: InpTF1/InpTF2/InpTF3 are stored below as raw ENUM_TIMEFRAMES values
; (15 = M15, 16385 = H1, 16388 = H4). If your MT5 build does not accept these
; lines for the timeframe inputs, just set them manually in the Inputs tab.
;
InpMagicNumber=20260914
InpSlippagePoints=30
InpTradeXAUUSDOnly=true
InpMaxOpenPositions=4
InpAllowOpposite=true
InpTimerSeconds=60
InpTF1=15
InpTF2=16385
InpTF3=16388
InpWeightTF1=1.0
InpWeightTF2=1.5
InpWeightTF3=2.0
InpRsiPeriod=14
InpRsiLookback=2
InpRsiBuyLevel=47.0
InpRsiSellLevel=47.0
InpMacdFast=12
InpMacdSlow=26
InpMacdSignal=9
InpBandsPeriod=20
InpBandsDeviation=2.0
InpSwingScanBars=30
InpSwingPivotWidth=2
InpEntryThreshold=55.0
InpMinAgreeingTF=2
InpSwingBonusPoints=15.0
InpShowDashboard=true
InpUseFixedLot=true
InpFixedLot=0.01
InpRiskPercent=0.2
InpStopLossPips=60.0
InpUseTakeProfit=true
InpTakeProfitPips=50.0
InpMaxLotSize=5.0
InpMaxDailyLossPct=1.0
InpUseDailyTarget=false
InpDailyTargetPct=0.5
InpCloseOnTarget=true
InpLockDailyGains=true
InpLockAfterPct=0.5
InpGiveBackPct=50.0
InpMaxTradesPerDay=0
InpUseBreakeven=true
InpBreakevenTriggerPips=20.0
InpBreakevenBufferPts=20
InpTrailStartPips=50.0
InpTrailPips=50.0
InpUseBrokerSession=true
InpEntryOpenBufferMin=1
InpEntryCloseBufferMin=5
InpFlattenBeforeClose=true
InpFlattenBeforeCloseMin=5
InpUseSessionFilter=true
InpSessionGmtOffset=4.0
InpSessionStartHour=0
InpSessionStartMin=0
InpSessionEndHour=0
InpSessionEndMin=0
InpCloseBeforeWeekend=true
InpWeekendCloseHour=20
InpMaxSpreadPoints=800
